{
  "id": "ybocs",
  "name": "Yale-Brown Obsessive Compulsive Scale (Y-BOCS)",
  "directions": "Clinician-administered severity interview. Rate all ten items using their item-specific anchors. Complete the symptom checklist and full interview using the authorized source. The app totals the ten severity ratings and reports the two five-item subscales; it does not diagnose.",
